\begin{center}
ABSTRACT
\end{center}
This paper is a sequel in which we derive and simplify
the gravitational equations that apply in accelerating 
cosmological spacetimes. Solutions to these equations 
should be  tantamount to all order re-summations of the 
perturbative leading logarithms. We also discuss possible 
phenomenological applications to cosmological observables.

