With \eqref{eq_fn}, we have $\mathcal{r}_{fn}<1-\alpha$.  When the required reliability $\alpha=0.9$, $\mathcal{r}_{fn}< 0.1$. According to Table \ref{tab_relia_ana},  the allowed remaining unknown tag ratio $r_{ud}\leq 0.15$ and we set $r_{ud}=0.10$ to meet the requirement.  Similarly, when $\alpha=0.95$ (resp. 0.99), we set $r_{ud}$ is smaller than 0.05 (resp. 0.01), respectively. Therefore, the number of remaining tags should meet

\begin{eqnarray} \label{eq_ud}
\mathcal{U}_d\leq\left\{ \begin{array}{l}
