density \cite{Palle6}. The angular correlations of the pulsar timing arrays
allow to estimate the present vorticity of the Universe to be $\frac{\omega_{0}}{H_{0}}=
{\cal O}(10^{-5})$ \cite{Palle7}.

We demonstrate that the spin densities through torsion activate the primordial density contrast
