\end{align} 
Based on temporal difference learning, we can consider $r+\gamma Q_i(s',\pi(a'|s'))$ as the learner's target value, and compare that against the predicted value of $Q_i(s,a)$. %\citep{sutton2018reinforcement}. 
By combining \autoref{eq:update_q} and \autoref{eq:denn_rl}, our overall policy evaluation step for each $Q_i$ in the ensemble will be:
