Figure~\ref{fig:doclen-parseable} illustrates the relationship between document length (in words) and parseability, separately for the open and targeted extraction scenarios. In both scenarios, documents that failed to parse tend to be longer, with noticeably higher medians and more dispersed distributions compared to parseable documents.



