\subsection{Growing the Efficient Frontier} \label{sec:frontier}

Our investigation focuses on the efficient frontiers spanned by test assets generated using (boosted) P-Tree.
Many P-Tree test assets have significant alphas over multiple well-known benchmark factor models, indicating those factor models cannot effectively span the efficient frontier.
The boosting technique enhances our ability to generate more effective test assets that expand the efficient frontier better, that is, ``growing the efficient frontiers on P-Trees."


