Further, we identify categories other than size, including momentum (\texttt{SUE, ABR, NINCR}), value (\texttt{BM\_IA, BM, CFP, EP}), profitability (\texttt{CHPM, ROA, ROE}), and frictions/volatility (\texttt{MAXRET, SVAR}), that vastly improve investment performance by a simple further split on the ME baseline P-Tree.


