\caption{Microseismic event epicenters from a potash mine in Saskatchewan. The catalog spans the time interval from January 1$^\mathrm{st}$, 2022, to November 15$^\mathrm{th}$, 2023. The colored solid circles show events with $m \geq -1.0$, while black solid circles represent events with magnitudes below $m < -1.0$. The colors of the circles reflect the  occurrence times of microevents, starting from January 1$^\mathrm{st}$, 2022, as given by the color bar. The light blue area illustrates the mine layout.}
