\caption{Spatial distribution of the microseismic event clusters that were identified by applying the generalized NND method. The solid circles with varying colors indicate events that belong to clusters with more than one event. The black solid circles show the single events. The threshold ${\log_{10}(\eta_\mathrm{thresh}) = \EtaThresh}$ was used to separate the events.}
