be a weighted marked stable map modelled on an augmented graph $\cG$ as in \autoref{def: augmented maps}. Suppose that $u$ is not simple. The construction described below will produce from this data a new augmented graph $\cG^s$ and a new, simpler weighted marked stable map modelled on $\cG^s$,
\[
    (C^s,\bp^s\cup (\bp')^s,u^s,\bm^s).
\]
Importantly, the corresponding homology classes will be related by
\[
    [\cG^s,\bm^s] = [\cG,\bm] \quad\text{and}\quad c_1([\cG^s]) \leq c_1([\cG]),
\]
which will allow us to carry out the induction process.

